  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Abandoned as an infant in the mystical Siuta Forest, Freya knows nothing of her past. Driven to uncover the truth of her origins, she becomes a priestess and embarks on a pilgrimage back to the forest. There, she begins dreaming of a red-haired man named Aran, whose appearance mirrors the kingdom's legendary hero from an ancient mural. As the dreams repeat, Freya starts to suspect they may hold a deeper meaning. Who is this man, and what is the truth behind their mysterious connection?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
